A optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\",\"knowsAbout\":[\"Federal Income Tax\",\"State Income Tax\",\"FICA Tax\",\"Payroll Tax\",\"IRS Compliance\",\"Tax Planning\",\"Multi-State Taxation\",\"Tax-Advantaged Accounts\"],\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rachelmitchellcpa/\",\"https://www.aicpa-cima.com/\"],\"worksFor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},\"image\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog#blog\",\"@type\":\"Blog\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc Blog\",\"description\":\"Expert tax guides, state-by-state comparisons, and financial tips from TheTaxCalc.\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\"},\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog#author\"},\"dateModified\":\"2026-02-01\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog#itemlist\",\"@type\":\"ItemList\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc Blog — Tax Guides, Tips & News\",\"description\":\"Expert tax guides, state-by-state comparisons, and financial tips from TheTaxCalc.\",\"numberOfItems\":55,\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/obbba-tax-refund-impact-2026\",\"name\":\"OBBBA Tax Refund Impact 2026: How It Changes Your Refund\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/how-to-calculate-federal-tax-refund-2026\",\"name\":\"How to Calculate Your 2026 Federal Tax Refund\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/2026-self-employed-tax-refund-calculator\",\"name\":\"Self-Employed Tax Refund Calculator 2026: SE Tax, Quarterly Payments & Deductions\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/2026-w2-tax-refund-calculator-guide\",\"name\":\"W-2 Tax Refund Calculator Guide 2026: Exact Numbers\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/2026-federal-tax-refund-estimator-guide\",\"name\":\"2026 Federal Tax Refund Estimator: How Much Back?\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/how-much-tax-on-100k-salary-by-state-2026\",\"name\":\"How Much Tax Do You Pay on a $100K Salary in Every State? (2026)\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":7,\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/inheritance-tax-guide-2026\",\"name\":\"Inheritance Tax Guide 2026: State-by-State Rules, Exemptions & Calculator\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":8,\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/401k-withdrawal-tax-guide-2026\",\"name\":\"401(k) Withdrawal Tax Guide 2026: Rules & Penalties\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":9,\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/retirement-tax-planning-guide-2026\",\"name\":\"Retirement Tax Planning Guide 2026: Strategies, Brackets & Withdrawals\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":10,\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/florida-tax-guide-2026\",\"name\":\"Florida Tax Guide 2026: No Income Tax & Sales Tax & Calculator\"}]},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog#breadcrumb\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\"}]}]}</script><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\"><a class=\"underline underline-offset-2 decoration-muted-foreground/40 hover:decoration-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors flex items-center gap-1\"